   "source": [
    "## Combined Task — Semester Report (submit this)\n",
    "\n",
    "Bring everything together into one program that:\n",
    "1. Defines a nested `gradebook` **dictionary** (at least 6 subjects, with `marks` and `credits`).\n",
    "2. Defines a `lab_submissions` **list** with at least 10 entries (with repeats).\n",
    "3. Computes the **unique subjects submitted** using a **set**.\n",
    "4. Computes the **high-scoring subjects (marks >= 85)** using a **set comprehension**.\n",
    "5. Computes the **best subject** as a **tuple** `(subject_name, marks)` — the highest-scoring subject overall.\n",
    "6. Prints all of the above in a clearly labelled semester report.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "20858789",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# TODO: Combined task solution
# 1. Define gradebook
gradebook = {
    "OS": {"marks": 85, "credits": 3},
    "DBMS": {"marks": 92, "credits": 3},
    "CN": {"marks": 78, "credits": 4},
    "DAA": {"marks": 88, "credits": 4},
    "SE": {"marks": 95, "credits": 3},
    "AI": {"marks": 91, "credits": 3}
}

# 2. Define lab submissions
lab_submissions = ["OS", "DBMS", "CN", "OS", "DAA", "DBMS", "OS", "SE", "AI", "AI"]

# 3. Unique subjects submitted
unique_subjects_submitted = set(lab_submissions)

# 4. High-scoring subjects
high_scoring_subjects = {
    subject for subject, details in gradebook.items()
    if details["marks"] >= 85
}

# 5. Best subject
best_subject = max(gradebook.items(), key=lambda item: item[1]["marks"])
best_subject_tuple = (best_subject[0], best_subject[1]["marks"])


# 6. Print report
print("--- Semester Report ---")
print(f"\nUnique Subjects Submitted ({len(unique_subjects_submitted)}):")
print(unique_subjects_submitted)

print(f"\nHigh-Scoring Subjects (>= 85 marks, {len(high_scoring_subjects)}):")
print(high_scoring_subjects)

print("\nBest Subject:")
print(f"  - Subject: {best_subject_tuple[0]}")
print(f"  - Marks: {best_subject_tuple[1]}")

print("\n--- End of Report ---")\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
